OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies causing man's
OL,4,Acareless driving death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied causing the death of a
OL,7,Fpedestrian and seriously injuring
OL,8,Fanother by careless driving in
OL,9,FDoncaster.
OL,11,FSheffield Crown Court heard Oleh
OL,12,FMykhailenko, 77, and Natalia
OL,13,FMykhailenko, 71, were hit by a Vauxhall
OL,14,FCorsa being driven by Jake Rowlands in
OL,15,FMill Street, Armthorpe, on 8 January.
OL,17,FOleh Mykhailenko was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fwhere he later died, while Natalia
OL,19,FMykhailenko suffered serious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
